Note on bundled knowledge base (kb/):

The knowledge base under `caofeng-ppt/kb/` contains technique parameters,
layout archetypes, color palettes and animation presets distilled from
third-party slide templates and tutorial videos. The copyright in those
original third-party works remains with their respective owners. This license
covers the original software code and the derived, abstract technique data
authored in this repository. It does not grant any rights to the underlying
third-party templates, videos or course materials. See SECURITY.md and the
project README for details.
